    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Recent references (2023–2024)</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', opacity: 0.8 }}>12 · Recent work</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
      <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>[11]</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>J. M. John, O. Shobayo, and B. Ogunleye, “An exploration of clustering algorithms for customer segmentation in the UK retail market,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Analytics</span>, vol. 2, no. 4, pp. 809–823, 2023.</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>https://doi.org/10.3390/analytics2040042 &nbsp;·&nbsp; compares K-Means, GMM, DBSCAN, agglomerative and BIRCH</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
      <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>[12]</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>R. J. Kuo, M. N. Alfareza, and T. P. Q. Nguyen, “Genetic based density peak possibilistic fuzzy c-means algorithms to cluster analysis — a case study on customer segmentation,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Engineering Science and Technology, an International Journal</span>, vol. 47, 101525, 2023.</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jestch.2023.101525 &nbsp;·&nbsp; uses ARI and NMI for validation</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
      <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>[13]</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>H. Hamidi and B. Haghi, “An approach based on data mining and genetic algorithm to optimizing time series clustering for efficient segmentation of customer behavior,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Computers in Human Behavior Reports</span>, vol. 16, 100520, 2024.</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chbr.2024.100520 &nbsp;·&nbsp; dynamic segmentation beyond a single snapshot</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '16px 22px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>These studies motivate two choices in this project: <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>validate against alternative algorithms</span> (Section 5.2) and treat <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>longitudinal segmentation</span> as future work (Section 7.3).</Text>
  </Box>

